Root Cause Workstreams
Workstream 1: Supplier Factoring
Owner: Treasury / AP
Actions:
Validate factoring vendors.
Auto-release approved factoring invoices.
Monthly review of blocked factoring transactions.
Workstream 2: Price & Quantity Discrepancy
Owner: Procurement / Receiving / AP
Actions:
Weekly mismatch review.
Buyer accountability matrix.
Escalation for aged discrepancies >30 days.
Workstream 3: Non-PO Invoices
Owner: Business Functions
Actions:
Improve PO compliance.
Introduce approval workflow SLA.
Reduce manual processing.
Workstream 4: Manual Blocks
Owner: AP Operations
Actions:
Mandatory block reason codes.
Monthly aging review.
Auto-notification for aged blocks.
Workstream 5: Debit Balance Recovery
Owner: AP Team
Actions:
Vendor confirmations.
Net-off opportunities.
Credit note recovery.
Duplicate payment recovery tracking.
